    {
      "slug": "asyst",
      "title": "Asyst Design System",
      "summary": "Anyday's design system template: one set of tokens, type and components that every client brand is built from, documented on a single site.",
      "tags": [
        "Design System",
        "Documentation"
      ],
      "scope": [
        "Foundations: colour, type, spacing, grid",
        "Component library",
        "Brand kit",
        "Usage guidelines & code"
      ],
      "role": "Design System",
      "date": "2026",
      "contributors": "Anyday",
      "cover": "asyst/cover.jpg",
      "hero": "asyst/hero.jpg",
      "sections": [
        {
          "heading": "The idea",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "Anyday builds many websites for multi-brand clients. Asyst is the template each one starts from: swap the brand tokens and the whole system re-themes, while components, rules and code stay the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Foundations",
          "content": [
            {
              "img": [
                {
                  "src": "asyst/colors.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                },
                {
                  "src": "asyst/typography.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "img": [
                {
                  "src": "asyst/spacing.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                },
                {
                  "src": "asyst/brand-kit.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Components",
          "content": [
            {
              "p": "Every component page shows the web and mobile versions, every state, the code to use, and the rules that keep teams from re-inventing it."
            },
            {
              "img": [
                {
                  "src": "asyst/event-card.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                },
                {
                  "src": "asyst/podcasts.jpg",
                  "size": "half"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "img": [
                {
                  "src": "asyst/buttons.jpg",
                  "size": "full"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Rules, not suggestions",
          "content": [
            {
              "ul": [
                "Colours are referenced by token, never by hex",
                "Tokens describe purpose, not appearance",
                "No one-off colours: propose a new token instead",
                "Web and mobile share the same token set"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
